   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "- many rider complaints are about not understanding their\npay, not the amount itself\n- sudden rating drops or pay changes with no explanation\nupset riders the most\n- Swiggy can fix this on its own, without needing to beat\ncompetitors first",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
