   "locked": false,
   "text": "- right now, fast grocery delivery costs Swiggy more than\nit earns\n- the future likely means fewer, smarter-placed\nwarehouses instead of just more of them\n- prices or delivery speed may need to change so this\npart of the business can survive",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 2,
